Author: Collie Kart project (based on CTRPluginFramework Blank Template)

Version:
    Major: 0
    Minor: 0
    Revision: 6

Targets:

Title: Collie Kart Portable P006

Summary: MK7 optional profiler and gated HID input experiment

Description: |
    P006 preserves passive MK7 telemetry and user-triggered CSV logging.
    Opt-in performance diagnostics track frame callback cadence and
    read durations; a dry-run-gated single-use HID InjectKey(A)
    experiment is included but unverified on real hardware.
    Manual B/START abort, telemetry watchdog and short expiry
    prevent repeated injection attempts. No autonomous navigation,
    reinforcement learning, or game RAM modifications.
    Input release relies on platform HID refresh and is NOT proven.

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
